                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does a travel app cost?</h3>
                                        <p>MVP OTA: ₹40-90 lakh ($48K-108K). Growth: ₹1.2-2.5 Cr ($145K-300K). Enterprise: ₹3-8 Cr ($360K-960K).</p>
                                        <h3>How long does GDS integration take?</h3>
                                        <p>Amadeus / Sabre integration: 4-8 weeks of technical work plus 2-4 weeks of certification. $10K-100K+ upfront cost.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I build a direct hotel app or use a white-label?</h3>
                                        <p>For 5+ properties or premium brand positioning, custom is worth it. For 1-2 properties, white-label (Guestline, Cloudbeds, Little Hotelier) is faster and cheaper.</p>
                                        <h3>Is AI worth building into travel apps in 2026?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes for personalization and concierge. Realistic ancillary revenue lift: 15-30%. Skip general 'AI assistant' features that aren't scoped to real user tasks.</p>
